        <p>
            <strong>Klehomerie</strong> (hereinafter referred to as the "Company") is committed to protecting your personal data in compliance with the General Data Protection Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and Greek Law 4624/2019. This notice outlines how we collect, use, and safeguard your information.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">

  <h3>1. Data Controller</h3>
        <p>The entity responsible for processing your personal data is:</p>
        <ul class="list-none pl-0">
            <li><strong>Company Name:</strong> Klehomerie (Arnaud Zerdab)</li>
            <li><strong>VAT Number (AFM):</strong> 174294556</li>
